  _list:
  - _responseId: 0
    _responseFI: "Tuu pelaamaan mun kanssa, t\xE4\xE4 vois olla tosi hauskaa!"
    _responseEN: Come play with me, this could be so much fun.
  - _responseId: 1
    _responseFI: "Jatketaan viel\xE4, t\xE4h\xE4n on liian hyv\xE4 lopettaa!"
    _responseEN: Let's continue. This ain't yet a time to stop.
  - _responseId: 2
    _responseFI: "Jes, m\xE4 tuun mukaan!"
    _responseEN: Yes, I'll join you!
  - _responseId: 3
    _responseFI: "Hei mahtavaa, m\xE4 tuun mukaan ainaki!"
    _responseEN: Brilliant, I want to join too!
  - _responseId: 4
    _responseFI: "Kyll\xE4! Ehdottomasti!"
    _responseEN: Yes! Absolutely!
  - _responseId: 5
    _responseFI: "Ei t\xE4ll\xE4 kertaa."
    _responseEN: Not this time.
  - _responseId: 6
    _responseFI: "Moro, moro t\xE4\xE4ll\xE4 ollaan t\xE4ynn\xE4 energiaa!"
    _responseEN: What's popping! I have so much energy!
  - _responseId: 7
    _responseFI: "Moikka, m\xE4 l\xE4hen nyt! Pit\xE4k\xE4\xE4 hauskaa!"
    _responseEN: Good bye, I'll leave now. Keep having fun.
  - _responseId: 8
    _responseFI: Pieni tauko, tuun koht takaisin kaverit!
    _responseEN: A moment, i'll be right back pals!
  - _responseId: 9
    _responseFI: "Voittoputki! T\xE4n\xE4\xE4n me vied\xE4\xE4n!"
    _responseEN: A streak! Todays the day!
  - _responseId: 10
    _responseFI: "Ei h\xE4ti\xE4 miti\xE4 kaverit, kyl t\xE4\xE4 t\xE4st\xE4."
    _responseEN: Not a problem guys, we'll rise again.
  - _responseId: 11
    _responseFI: "Discord on tulessa! Tuu mukaan, tavataan oikeita ihmisi\xE4! Linkki
      nettisivuilla!"
    _responseEN: Discord's on fire! Come join us and meet. Link is in the website.
  - _responseId: 12
    _responseFI: "Oho, nyt on kyl hiljasta! J\xE4in ihan yksin."
    _responseEN: Well I'll be. It's pretty quiet here! Almost like I'm alone here.
  - _responseId: 13
    _responseFI: "T\xE4\xE4 peli on ihan PARAS!!!"
    _responseEN: This. Game. Is. The. BEST!!!
  - _responseId: 14
    _responseFI: "Haha, t\xE4\xE4 peli on ihan paska, mutta jotenkin se vaan naurattaa!"
    _responseEN: Haha, this game blows, but somehow I just find it funny!
  - _responseId: 15
    _responseFI: "Saa auttaa, oon v\xE4h\xE4n kujalla t\xE4st\xE4 pelist\xE4."
    _responseEN: Help appreciated, I'm kinda lost with this game.
